{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Cooking Accident", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Laughing About It", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 10, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Expressing Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you express an opinion, you give your ideas on a topic.  You can use some inseparable phrasal verbs when you give opinions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Some phrases we use to give opinions are : <br/> <span class=\"italic\">I don't think ..., I'm certain ..., I believe ..., It's quite obvious ...</span>,  and  <span class=\"italic\">I'm pretty sure ...</span><br/><br/>  You use phrasal verbs when you want to be less formal. They are very common in spoken English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">get into<br/><br/>  get into<br/><br/>  get on<br/><br/>  get on<br/><br/>  get through<br/><br/>  get down to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"begin<br/><br/>   be interested in<br/><br/>  make progress toward<br/><br/>  start <br/><br/> read<br/><br/>  start; focus on\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I think that you really <span class=\"strong\">got on</span> to a great idea Sal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I feel that they would really <span class=\"strong\">get into</span> it", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm certain people would want to <span class=\"strong\">go through</span> what we made and how we made it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm pretty sure that I could find someone <span class=\"strong\">to get on it</span>.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I think we may really <span class=\"strong\">get into</span> a new area with this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Don't you think it's about time <span class=\"strong\">to get down to</span> some serious eating?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details on what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You ask for clarification when it is not clear what the other person is referring to. You ask the other person to be more specific by giving you more information. <br/><br/>  You can use a question at the beginning of a statement or question to ask for clarification like: <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span><br/><br/> Questions within sentences are called embedded questions. <br/><br/>  Example: <br/> <span class=\"strong\">Simple question</span>: <span class=\"italic\">What are you going to do after dinner?</span><br/> <span class=\"strong\">Embedded question</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Do you know what you're going to do after dinner?</span><br/><br/>  Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Main Question</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Embedded Question</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who/ ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can also use a direct question.<br/>Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Is that a hint?</span><br/><br/>  Direct questions go straight to the point. Sometimes they are used to be light-hearted or to be funny.<br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm really hungry now!<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You mean there are times when you're not?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you mean what I said about the booklets?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Are you asking me if I know someone who could print them up?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Are you saying that you might know someone?", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I'm not sure what you mean.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk over ideas.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get on to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to begin to talk about a new subject", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think that you really got on to a great idea Sal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm pretty sure that I could find someone to get on it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get into ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to find interesting", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I feel that they would really get into it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get into ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become involved in ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think we may really get into a new area with this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to go through", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to read", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm certain people would want to go through what we made.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to toss", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to mix  food lightly so as to cover with dressing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Now toss the salad gently. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "You will teach your foreign friends how to make a traditional dish from your country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "With a partner, decide which dish you'd like to teach.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of ingredients needed.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a recipe explaining how to cook your dish in your own words.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Then, just like a cooking show, video record yourself in a kitchen making the dish while you explain the process.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Post your video online so you can share it with your classmates.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I teach people about traditional food.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I analyze information and make it easy to understand.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present my recipe in a clear and concise manner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give feedback to others.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get down to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to start", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't you think it's about time to get down to some serious eating?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le10ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn8le10ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think that you've really got on to a great idea Sal. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you mean what I said about the booklets?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Yeah. I'm certain people would want to go through what we made and how we made it. I feel that they would really get into it. They should look professional.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are you asking me if I know someone who can print them up?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Are you saying that you might know someone?"}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "19700", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm pretty sure that I could find someone to get on it.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You could get it started?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I don't see why not. I think we may really get into a new area with this.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure what you mean.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I just see things starting to happen. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Now back to toss the salad gently. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No it was wash the rice gently."}, {"image": "engenn8le10ob10re2img02.jpg", "time": "39000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How do you toast those seeds and nuts?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Just mix them with a tiny bit of oil, spread them on a pan and bake them in the oven.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That looks easy enough.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't you think it's about time to get down to some serious eating?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you mean you're finally going to feed me? I'm dying of starvation over here!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le10ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le10ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about food and how to prepare it.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can explain my opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarifications. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Where does your mother or grandmother or aunt keep their treasured recipes?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How often do they give them out to people?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's put together some 